{"id":"8ac761f4b9c5f219","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/560_拓扑模态逻辑.md","title":"560 拓扑模态逻辑","display":"560_拓扑模态逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{560}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{560}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to B,\\Box A\">\\(p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to B,\\Box A\\)</span>。派生记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\n\\qquad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\n\\qquad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{560}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{560}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\">\\(\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、绑定与替换\">3. 自由变元、绑定与替换</h1>\n<p>自由命题变元函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{560}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{560}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{560}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{560}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{560}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{560}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{560}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,560}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{560}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{560}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{560}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,560}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{560}=\\operatorname{PV}_{560}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{560}=\\operatorname{PV}_{560}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有限支撑替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{560}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{560}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{560}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{560})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{560}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{560}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{560}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{560})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{560}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{560}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{560}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{560}\\)</span>，替换满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(B,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(B,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(\\Box A,\\sigma)=\\Box\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(\\Box A,\\sigma)=\\Box\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{560}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{560}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{560}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{560}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{560}\n=\n\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{560}\n=\n\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{560}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{560}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>盒算子的句法公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{560}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{560}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{560}\n=\n\\{\\Box A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{560}\n=\n\\{\\Box A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{560}\n=\n\\{\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{560}\n=\n\\{\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{560}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{560}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{560}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{560}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{560}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{560}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{560}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{560}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{560}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{560}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{560}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{560}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{560}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{560}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{560}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{560}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{560}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{560}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{560}\n=\n\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{560}\n=\n\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Box A}\\ (Nec).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Box A}\\ (Nec).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{560}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{560}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{560}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{560}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{560}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{560}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>必然化规则只允许从空依赖行使用。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{560}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{560}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\)</span>，并且每行至少满足下列 4 个条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{560}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{560}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{560}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{560}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{560}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{560}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{560}(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m})=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{560}(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m})=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{560}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{560}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{560}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{560}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{560}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{560}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{560}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{560}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{560}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{560}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-证明证书\">8. 证明证书</h1>\n<p>一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"560\">\\(560\\)</span>-证明证书是四元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Gamma,\\pi,A,\\Delta)\">\\((\\Gamma,\\pi,A,\\Delta)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{560}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{560}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 的末行为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Delta,A)\">\\((\\Delta,A)\\)</span>。证书合法性完全由第 6 节的四类行条件判定。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-拓扑语义载体与后承\">9. 拓扑语义载体与后承</h1>\n<p>拓扑谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Top}_{560}(X,\\tau)\n\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\n\\land\\varnothing\\in\\tau\n\\land X\\in\\tau\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U,V\\in\\tau\\ (U\\cap V\\in\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\ \n\\left(\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\in\\tau\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Top}_{560}(X,\\tau)\n\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\n\\land\\varnothing\\in\\tau\n\\land X\\in\\tau\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U,V\\in\\tau\\ (U\\cap V\\in\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\ \n\\left(\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\in\\tau\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>拓扑模型集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TopMod}_{560}\n=\n\\{(X,\\tau,V):X\\ne\\varnothing,\\ \\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X),\\ \\operatorname{Top}_{560}(X,\\tau),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{560}\\to\\mathcal P(X)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TopMod}_{560}\n=\n\\{(X,\\tau,V):X\\ne\\varnothing,\\ \\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X),\\ \\operatorname{Top}_{560}(X,\\tau),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{560}\\to\\mathcal P(X)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义内部算子的依赖域</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{IntDom}_{560}\n=\n\\{(X,\\tau,Y):X\\ne\\varnothing,\\ \\operatorname{Top}_{560}(X,\\tau),\\ Y\\subseteq X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{IntDom}_{560}\n=\n\\{(X,\\tau,Y):X\\ne\\varnothing,\\ \\operatorname{Top}_{560}(X,\\tau),\\ Y\\subseteq X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>全局内部算子定义为函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Int}_{560}:\n\\mathsf{IntDom}_{560}\n\\to\n\\bigcup_{(X,\\tau,Y)\\in\\mathsf{IntDom}_{560}}\\mathcal P(X),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Int}_{560}:\n\\mathsf{IntDom}_{560}\n\\to\n\\bigcup_{(X,\\tau,Y)\\in\\mathsf{IntDom}_{560}}\\mathcal P(X),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Int}_{560}(X,\\tau,Y)=\\bigcup\\{U\\in\\tau:U\\subseteq Y\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Int}_{560}(X,\\tau,Y)=\\bigcup\\{U\\in\\tau:U\\subseteq Y\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(X,\\tau,V)\\in\\mathsf{TopMod}_{560}\">\\(M=(X,\\tau,V)\\in\\mathsf{TopMod}_{560}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ A⟧_M^{560}=\\{y\\in X:M,y\\models_{560}A\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ A⟧_M^{560}=\\{y\\in X:M,y\\models_{560}A\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并递归给出满足关系：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,x\\models_{560}p\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,x\\not\\models_{560}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,x\\models_{560}p\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,x\\not\\models_{560}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,x\\models_{560}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,x\\models_{560}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,x\\models_{560}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,x\\models_{560}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,x\\models_{560}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,x\\models_{560}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,x\\models_{560}B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,x\\models_{560}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,x\\models_{560}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,x\\models_{560}B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,x\\models_{560}\\Box A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nx\\in\\operatorname{Int}_{560}(X,\\tau,⟦ A⟧_M^{560}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,x\\models_{560}\\Box A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nx\\in\\operatorname{Int}_{560}(X,\\tau,⟦ A⟧_M^{560}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{560}^{\\mathsf{top}}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{560}^{\\mathsf{top}}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(X,\\tau,V)\\in\\mathsf{TopMod}_{560}\">\\(M=(X,\\tau,V)\\in\\mathsf{TopMod}_{560}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,x\\models_{560}B)\">\\(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,x\\models_{560}B)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,x\\models_{560}A\">\\(M,x\\models_{560}A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目把盒算子的句法公理集合固定为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{560}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{560}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{560}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{560}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{560}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{560}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合被固定为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{560}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{560}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{560}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{560}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{560}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{560}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{560}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{560}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{560}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{560}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{560}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{560}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{560}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{560}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{560}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{560}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>下列公式模式只作为排除对象列出，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{560}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{560}\\)</span> 的并集项：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Pat}_{5}^{560}\n=\n\\{\\Diamond A\\to\\Box\\Diamond A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Pat}_{5}^{560}\n=\n\\{\\Diamond A\\to\\Box\\Diamond A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_{560}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{560},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{560},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{560},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{560},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{560},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,560},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{560},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{560},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{560},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{560},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{560},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{560},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{560},\n\\operatorname{last}_{560},\n\\vdash_{560},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{560},\n\\operatorname{Top}_{560},\n\\mathsf{IntDom}_{560},\n\\operatorname{Int}_{560},\n\\mathsf{TopMod}_{560},\n\\models_{560},\n\\models_{560}^{\\mathsf{top}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T_{560}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{560},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{560},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{560},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{560},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{560},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,560},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{560},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{560},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{560},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{560},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{560},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{560},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{560},\n\\operatorname{last}_{560},\n\\vdash_{560},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{560},\n\\operatorname{Top}_{560},\n\\mathsf{IntDom}_{560},\n\\operatorname{Int}_{560},\n\\mathsf{TopMod}_{560},\n\\models_{560},\n\\models_{560}^{\\mathsf{top}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含拓扑模态逻辑的句法、公理、规则、证明对象、可证性、拓扑模型、内部算子满足关系和语义后承；不含可靠性证明、完备性证明或模型检查算法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、绑定与替换","text":"3. 自由变元、绑定与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-证明证书","text":"8. 证明证书","level":1},{"id":"9.-拓扑语义载体与后承","text":"9. 拓扑语义载体与后承","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分","text":"10. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{560}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i<k\\})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}.","display":true},{"tex":"p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to B,\\Box A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\n\\qquad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{560}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}_{560}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{560}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(A),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{560}(A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BV}_{560}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{560}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{560}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,560}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{560}=\\operatorname{PV}_{560}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Subst}_{560}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{560}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{560}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{560})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{560}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{560}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(A,\\sigma),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(B,\\sigma),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(\\Box A,\\sigma)=\\Box\\operatorname{Sub}_{560}(A,\\sigma).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{560}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{560}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{560}\n=\n\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{560}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{560}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{560}\n=\n\\{\\Box A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{560}\n=\n\\{\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}_{560}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{560}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{560}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{560}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{560}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{560}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{560}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{560}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{560}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{560}\n=\n\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{560}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\frac